        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Cut a Landscape Clip for Vertical\n\nResizes a landscape clip to a 1080 by 1920 vertical frame for channels that expect 9:16. It is the step between having footage and being able to post it.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Clip\" takes the 16:9 video. \"2 To 9:16\" resizes it to a width of 1080 and a height of 1920. \"3 Vertical\" shows the vertical clip.\n\n**Try this:** Set width and height on \"2 To 9:16\" to 1080 by 1350 for a 4:5 feed post instead."
        },
